2026-09-14 | NOTE | negative-control method: do NOT compare screenshot file hashes. The systray carries
                       live counters (unread messages, activities) that change between runs, so two
                       captures of an identical UI legitimately differ by tens of bytes. Compare
                       pixels and inspect the bounding box, or the check produces a false failure.
                       The acceptance criterion is "no differing pixel outside the dynamic systray".

